WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:13.310
Health check: checks every flow, automation, saved message, form and scenario together: repeated keywords, missing texts, app limits, broken links and dead ends.

2
00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:18.290
Open the page; the "Health check before publishing" runs by itself.

3
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:24.710
Fix the red items and look at the yellow ones; click an item to open it where it lives.

4
00:00:25.261 --> 00:00:28.180
After fixing, click "Review again".

5
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:34.520
A yellow warning doesn't block anything, but it's usually where a customer gets confused.
